# Mac
.DS_Store

# Firebase Admin SDK service account — NEVER commit this!
serviceAccountKey.json
*.serviceAccountKey.json
**/serviceAccountKey.json

# Google Cloud service-account keys download with a project-prefixed name
# (e.g. workspace-airbuddy-a81f8c78e206.json), which the patterns above do not
# catch. The Calendar sync key is one of these — it is a live credential that
# can impersonate every employee's calendar, so a stray `git add .` must not be
# able to pick it up. The key belongs in the CALENDAR_SA_KEY secret, never on
# disk in the repo.
workspace-airbuddy-*.json
*-service-account*.json
gcp-key*.json

# Migration scripts (LO-10: moved to scripts/ — ignore scoped correctly)
scripts/